{
  "id": "v3.installer_config_verification",
  "version": "1",
  "description": "安装入口配置验证对象流：从一次公开 installer 调用选择非空验证配置，交由现有 V3 Config owner 编译，并把成功、失败或取消收敛为一次安装调用终态。图只描述配置消费者边界，不复制各 installer 的后续安装、restart 或 health 实现。",
  "inputs": [
    {
      "id": "installer-invocation",
      "schema": "Object",
      "schema_ref": "v3.installer_config_verification.arc.invocation"
    }
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "select_installer_verification_config",
      "operator": "routecodex.v3.install.select_installer_verification_config",
      "operator_version": "1",
      "inputs": ["installer-invocation"],
      "output": {
        "id": "selected-config-intent",
        "schema": "Object",
        "schema_ref": "v3.installer_config_verification.arc.selected_config_intent"
      },
      "input_selector": { "include": [], "exclude": [], "predicate": null },
      "output_selector": { "include": [], "exclude": [], "predicate": null },
      "iterator": "Whole",
      "resources": { "reads": [], "writes": [] },
      "notes": "按 ROUTECODEX_INSTALL_VERIFY_CONFIG、RCC_INSTALL_VERIFY_CONFIG、$HOME/.rcc/config.toml 的非空优先级选择路径；不读取 legacy 默认文件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "compile_selected_installer_config",
      "operator": "routecodex.v3.config.load_v3_config_snapshot_from_path",
      "operator_version": "1",
      "inputs": ["selected-config-intent"],
      "output": {
        "id": "selected-config-snapshot",
        "schema": "Object",
        "schema_ref": "v3.installer_config_verification.arc.selected_config_snapshot"
      },
      "input_selector": { "include": [], "exclude": [], "predicate": null },
      "output_selector": { "include": [], "exclude": [], "predicate": null },
      "iterator": "Whole",
      "resources": { "reads": ["v3.user_config.file_source"], "writes": [] },
      "notes": "复用 Config owner 的精确文件名 dispatcher；默认 config.toml 进入 V3UserConfigStore，显式 legacy 文件名仍按既有显式覆盖语义处理。"
    },
    {
      "id": "publish_installer_config_disposition",
      "operator": "routecodex.v3.install.publish_installer_config_disposition",
      "operator_version": "1",
      "inputs": ["selected-config-snapshot"],
      "output": {
        "id": "installer-config-disposition",
        "schema": "Object",
        "schema_ref": "v3.installer_config_verification.arc.disposition"
      },
      "input_selector": { "include": [], "exclude": [], "predicate": null },
      "output_selector": { "include": [], "exclude": [], "predicate": null },
      "iterator": "Whole",
      "resources": { "reads": [], "writes": [] },
      "notes": "成功、配置失败或调用取消都只产出一个最终 disposition；不把失败转换为成功，也不在图中形成重试回边。"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "from": "select_installer_verification_config",
      "to": "compile_selected_installer_config",
      "arc_id": "selected-config-intent"
    },
    {
      "from": "compile_selected_installer_config",
      "to": "publish_installer_config_disposition",
      "arc_id": "selected-config-snapshot"
    }
  ],
  "outputs": ["installer-config-disposition"]
}
